            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Mike is correct here ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Mike is correct here "
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "sgid": "BAh7CEkiCGdpZAY6BkVUSSI8Z2lkOi8vanVtcHN0YXJ0LWFwcC9Db21tdW5pdHlNZW1iZXIvNzUzNDk3MDc_ZXhwaXJlc19pbgY7AFRJIgxwdXJwb3NlBjsAVEkiFHJpY2hfdGV4dF9maWVsZAY7AFRJIg9leHBpcmVzX2F0BjsAVDA=--f50aa46255391afdc7b0c54f282646fcee243174"
                },
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "@Yujin Lee"
              },
              {
                "text": ".",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "In the Session 3 assessment prompt, it states:",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "In the Session 3 assessment prompt, it states:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "\"My business may have multiple products or services, and I should go through this questionnaire for each one. For this assessment, let's focus on the one that brings my company the highest revenue.\"",
                "type": "text",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ],
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\"My business may have multiple products or services, and I should go through this questionnaire for each one. For this assessment, let's focus on the one that brings my company the highest revenue.\""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "And the Level 1 example naming convention in the 4-Level Documentation Framework shows:",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "And the Level 1 example naming convention in the 4-Level Documentation Framework shows:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
