                "text": "So start with one service, the one generating the highest revenue. Run the assessment for that service, then build the Level 1 and Level 2 SOPs for it. Don't try to map all seven services at once.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "So start with one service, the one generating the highest revenue. Run the assessment for that service, then build the Level 1 and Level 2 SOPs for it. Don't try to map all seven services at once."
